WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.791
Unit twenty-one. My Body Belongs to Me!

2
00:00:04.766 --> 00:00:08.576
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:12.360
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:16.583
Today we learn about My Body Belongs to Me. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.289 --> 00:00:20.756
Body. Say it with me. Body!

6
00:00:24.246 --> 00:00:27.763
Private. Say it with me. Private!

7
00:00:31.242 --> 00:00:34.409
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

8
00:00:37.933 --> 00:00:41.200
No. Say it with me. No!

9
00:00:44.698 --> 00:00:47.765
Tell. Say it with me. Tell!

10
00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:54.559
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

11
00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:01.457
Adult. Say it with me. Adult!

12
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:08.291
Brave. Say it with me. Brave!

13
00:01:11.839 --> 00:01:20.856
My body belongs to me. Some parts of my body are private. If a touch makes me feel unsafe, I can say no, go away, and tell an adult I trust — that is brave.

14
00:01:20.906 --> 00:01:22.092
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.421 --> 00:01:28.594
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.644 --> 00:01:29.794
Safe!

17
00:01:30.627 --> 00:01:35.877
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.927 --> 00:01:37.077
Adult!

19
00:01:37.954 --> 00:01:46.175
Did you know? You should never keep a secret that makes you feel scared or unsafe — telling a trusted adult is always okay!

20
00:01:46.225 --> 00:01:48.117
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.819 --> 00:01:57.360
Think and answer. Which grown-ups could you tell if something feels unsafe?

22
00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:58.560
Great answer!

23
00:01:59.654 --> 00:02:04.400
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:07.078
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

